WEBVTT

01:26.550 --> 01:29.730
[Glory]

01:30.440 --> 01:32.940
[Episode 10]

01:41.590 --> 01:44.479
Just now, Lady Yunwan...

01:49.229 --> 01:50.850
-Come here!
-Come catch us!

01:50.870 --> 01:51.759
Wanwan, come here!

01:51.759 --> 01:53.070
Come here! You can't get it!

01:53.070 --> 01:54.000
Give it to me!

01:54.000 --> 01:55.430
You can't have it!

01:55.430 --> 01:57.470
At that time, my mother
had just passed away.

01:57.470 --> 01:59.910
The domestic affairs were left unattended.

01:59.910 --> 02:01.760
She was my father's favored concubine

02:01.760 --> 02:04.160
and had given birth
to Shanchang and Yun'e.

02:04.350 --> 02:05.000
Go on, cry!

02:05.350 --> 02:07.280
You even caused your own mother's death,

02:07.280 --> 02:08.840
and now I'm stuck with you!

02:09.310 --> 02:10.120
You want to cry?

02:10.120 --> 02:11.430
I'll make you cry!

02:12.240 --> 02:14.520
Wanwan hated the Butterfly-Flower
more than anything.

02:14.520 --> 02:15.720
The moment she saw it,

02:16.510 --> 02:18.770
she wanted to tear the villain to shreds,

02:19.200 --> 02:21.530
grind them into mud
and turn them to ashes.

02:25.710 --> 02:28.110
There is one thing
I have never understood.

02:28.590 --> 02:30.750
I would appreciate your guidance,
Lady Shanbao.

02:30.750 --> 02:32.350
What exactly is the Tea Bone?

02:35.000 --> 02:36.630
Back then, the Rong family ancestors

02:36.630 --> 02:38.960
were the first
to bring tea seeds to Linji.

02:39.310 --> 02:40.870
They taught the local people

02:40.870 --> 02:43.030
how to grow tea and process tea.

02:43.960 --> 02:45.160
They spared no effort

02:45.560 --> 02:48.030
to collect precious tea varieties
from far and wide.

02:48.030 --> 02:50.960
They established tea plantations,
promoted tea culture

02:50.960 --> 02:52.890
and benefited the people of Linji.

02:53.470 --> 02:55.400
Over the centuries that followed,

02:55.520 --> 02:58.400
the Rong family has produced
many renowned tea-making masters.

02:58.400 --> 02:59.520
Among them, those

03:00.080 --> 03:01.750
with exceptional talent in tea

03:01.750 --> 03:03.410
are called Tea Bone by people,

03:04.000 --> 03:06.240
earning great respect
from tea farmers everywhere.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.840
We are born knowing nothing.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.470
Even the most talented

03:09.470 --> 03:10.590
must study hard.

03:11.000 --> 03:13.360
How can there be such a thing
as a natural Tea Bone?

03:13.360 --> 03:16.140
Moreover, if a Tea Bone
can be born in the Rong family,

03:16.140 --> 03:16.840
then they can be

03:16.840 --> 03:18.520
born in other families too.

03:19.110 --> 03:21.470
Isn't it reckless to pass down this title
based solely on one's family lineage?

03:21.470 --> 03:23.840
The legend that a Tea Bone is reincarnated
among the common folk

03:23.840 --> 03:24.800
has been the earnest wish

03:24.800 --> 03:26.600
of tea farmers for generations.

03:26.800 --> 03:29.079
They long to see the Tea Ancestor
return to this world

03:29.079 --> 03:31.210
and help people with tea cultivation.

03:31.240 --> 03:34.100
As for why the title
ended up with the Rong family...

03:34.750 --> 03:37.750
Since ancient times, Emperors
have been called the Sons of Heaven.

03:37.750 --> 03:38.680
Why don't you ask

03:39.120 --> 03:40.980
if they deserve that lofty title?

03:43.520 --> 03:44.120
Fine.

03:44.920 --> 03:46.480
Then I'll not ask about ancient history.

03:46.480 --> 03:48.540
I'll only focus on the matter at hand.

03:48.750 --> 03:50.480
Lady Shanbao, you already knew

03:50.590 --> 03:52.190
it was the Lady Yunxi's trap?

03:53.000 --> 03:54.000
Rong Shanchang believed he

03:54.000 --> 03:55.329
had got something on me,

03:55.870 --> 03:56.600
but in truth,

03:56.960 --> 03:58.960
he was merely bait set by Rong Yunxi.

03:59.040 --> 04:00.500
She could test the waters.

04:01.560 --> 04:03.420
Why couldn't I draw the enemy out?

04:05.040 --> 04:07.300
Lady Yunxi used the Young Master as bait.

04:07.960 --> 04:08.590
And I am

04:09.800 --> 04:11.310
also your bait, right?

04:13.080 --> 04:14.080
Aren't you angry?

04:16.240 --> 04:18.399
Lady Shanbao,
this concerns your life and safety.

04:18.399 --> 04:20.290
You place your trust solely in me
instead of others.

04:20.290 --> 04:21.440
I ought to be glad.

04:22.270 --> 04:23.800
The imperial court holds examinations

04:23.800 --> 04:25.200
to recruit men of talent,

04:25.240 --> 04:25.950
seeking nothing but

04:25.950 --> 04:27.960
those who benefit the country
and its people.

04:27.960 --> 04:29.290
As we live in this world,

04:29.830 --> 04:31.690
it's better to be a useful person.

04:32.350 --> 04:33.040
However,

04:33.750 --> 04:35.950
privileges and official posts

04:36.650 --> 04:38.720
are the Emperor's benevolent efforts
to attract talent.

04:38.720 --> 04:41.170
Lady Shanbao,
if you want to use me in the future,

04:41.170 --> 04:42.630
what will you do to keep me?

04:56.020 --> 04:57.880
Silver has been upgraded to gold.

04:57.960 --> 05:00.290
Lady Shanbao, you truly spare no expense.

05:02.600 --> 05:03.730
But it is not enough.

05:09.440 --> 05:10.790
[Land Deed]

05:09.560 --> 05:11.310
Gold and silver are merely dead assets.

05:11.310 --> 05:14.570
Farmland and thriving shops
can keep generating profits.

05:18.300 --> 05:21.060
Lady Shanbao,
what you offer is more than sufficient

05:21.060 --> 05:22.520
to hire me as your steward.

05:23.240 --> 05:23.870
But if you want me

05:23.870 --> 05:25.870
to keep working my heart out for you,

05:26.310 --> 05:27.770
then it is far from enough.

05:36.510 --> 05:38.170
You don't want gold or silver.

05:38.760 --> 05:40.690
You don't want land deeds or shops.

05:40.920 --> 05:42.380
Then what else do you want?

05:54.310 --> 05:55.110
How dare you!

06:02.570 --> 06:04.600
Lady Shanbao, this is your chamber.

06:10.830 --> 06:11.350
Get out!

06:14.930 --> 06:19.590
♪ Get caught in a heavy, wild snowfall ♪

06:15.740 --> 06:16.540
Lady Shanbao.

06:19.670 --> 06:23.400
♪ Watch magpies fluttering past my eyes ♪

06:23.600 --> 06:27.760
♪ It's tormenting itself all alone ♪

06:24.190 --> 06:25.310
Every word I spoke

06:25.630 --> 06:27.160
was from the bottom of my heart.

06:27.160 --> 06:28.600
Lady Shanbao, please forgive my boldness

06:27.980 --> 06:32.080
♪ Unable to find any peers
for a get-together ♪

06:28.950 --> 06:30.210
and forget what I said.

06:31.000 --> 06:32.430
I shall never forget your kindness
in saving my life.

06:32.430 --> 06:36.590
♪ Wait for a perfectly full moon ♪

06:32.750 --> 06:34.310
Lady Shanbao,
if you have any orders in the future,

06:34.310 --> 06:35.680
I will always serve you.

06:36.600 --> 06:40.900
♪ Yet every slice of it seems incomplete ♪

06:40.930 --> 06:44.900
♪ Is it because my prayers
are too presumptuous? ♪

06:45.140 --> 06:49.909
♪ Or do I lack a bit
of the sacrificial blood? ♪

06:48.560 --> 06:49.480
Wait outside.

06:54.890 --> 06:59.400
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

06:59.430 --> 07:03.820
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

07:04.080 --> 07:06.500
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

07:06.530 --> 07:09.170
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

07:09.380 --> 07:11.950
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

07:11.980 --> 07:16.230
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

07:16.260 --> 07:20.820
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

07:21.580 --> 07:24.790
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

07:24.810 --> 07:28.630
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

07:29.080 --> 07:32.630
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

07:55.110 --> 07:57.250
I'm here to watch the ceremony.
Is that a problem?

07:57.250 --> 07:58.600
Mr. Lu, what about you?

08:00.270 --> 08:02.270
I'm also here to watch the ceremony.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.560
I presume you all know

08:08.220 --> 08:09.300
my eldest granddaughter

08:09.300 --> 08:10.630
is of marriageable age.

08:11.430 --> 08:13.090
On this auspicious occasion,

08:13.310 --> 08:14.240
I wish to select

08:14.680 --> 08:16.270
a handsome and virtuous man

08:16.950 --> 08:18.480
to be her lifelong partner.

08:20.770 --> 08:21.420
Bao.

09:31.050 --> 09:32.340
Lady Rong Shanbao.

09:34.370 --> 09:36.400
Don't make the wrong choice.

09:49.790 --> 09:50.720
What's going on?

09:51.910 --> 09:53.770
Has she still not made up her mind?

09:54.270 --> 09:55.930
What is Yang Dingchen saying?

09:56.910 --> 09:58.390
Something seems off.

09:59.000 --> 10:00.600
She was so decisive and resolute,

10:00.600 --> 10:02.550
but now she's acting all coy and hesitant.

10:02.550 --> 10:03.360
Ridiculous.

10:03.840 --> 10:04.410
Bao.

10:56.380 --> 10:58.240
Lady Rong Shanbao, congratulations to you

10:58.240 --> 10:59.970
on your engagement to Mr. Yang.

11:00.720 --> 11:01.480
You're truly

11:01.480 --> 11:03.150
a perfect match.

11:04.150 --> 11:05.610
What an unexpected union.

11:16.150 --> 11:17.010
Old Madam Rong.

11:17.720 --> 11:18.240
Our He family

11:18.240 --> 11:20.440
would like to offer the secret recipe
of Huqiu Tea as the betrothal gift

11:20.440 --> 11:22.100
to marry your granddaughter.

11:22.720 --> 11:23.620
Mr. He...

11:24.240 --> 11:26.390
Old Madam Rong,
please don't misunderstand me.

11:26.390 --> 11:27.980
I wish to marry

11:28.920 --> 11:29.920
Lady Yunshu.

11:32.000 --> 11:34.550
What? You want to marry Rong Yunshu?

12:06.910 --> 12:08.960
It's good that you've come
to your senses, Young Master.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.270
The Yan family is rich and powerful.

12:10.270 --> 12:11.840
You could marry any woman you want.

12:11.840 --> 12:13.550
No need to put up with this nonsense.

12:13.550 --> 12:14.150
Let's just

12:14.240 --> 12:15.970
pack our things and go home now!

12:16.070 --> 12:16.550
Wait.

12:19.930 --> 12:21.370
[Tea]

12:28.550 --> 12:29.410
This is the one.

12:30.270 --> 12:32.200
Lady Shanbao has been looking for it
for a long time.

12:32.200 --> 12:33.470
Send it to her.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.640
Young Master,

12:36.910 --> 12:39.040
Lady Shanbao is already engaged
to someone else.

12:39.040 --> 12:40.480
If you're not upset, so be it.

12:40.480 --> 12:42.120
But why aren't you the least bit anxious?

12:42.120 --> 12:44.240
True mastery lies in apparent clumsiness.

12:44.240 --> 12:46.370
Real wisdom resides in seeming folly.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.480
In my cultivation,
I was too rigid and stubborn,

12:48.480 --> 12:50.410
often too foolish to see the light.

12:50.510 --> 12:51.320
We must understand that success

12:51.320 --> 12:53.440
comes only through countless trials
and tribulations.

12:53.440 --> 12:54.300
At this moment,

12:54.790 --> 12:57.190
I suppose someone is more anxious
than I am.

12:57.440 --> 12:58.080
Calm down.

12:59.630 --> 13:00.280
Go now.

13:02.200 --> 13:03.260
How could it be him?

13:03.480 --> 13:04.980
How could it possibly be him?

13:04.980 --> 13:05.840
He was clearly about

13:05.840 --> 13:07.120
to be expelled from the Rong Mansion.

13:07.120 --> 13:07.720
Why did Shanbao

13:07.720 --> 13:09.180
suddenly change her mind?

13:09.590 --> 13:11.740
Now that Lady Shanbao
has chosen her husband,

13:11.740 --> 13:13.000
I should pack my things

13:13.480 --> 13:15.210
and return to the academy soon.

13:21.930 --> 13:23.380
Mr. Bai, please wait.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.750
The Rong family has always been generous.

13:25.750 --> 13:27.670
They would never give others reasons
to criticize them.

13:27.670 --> 13:28.840
Mr. Bai, you've come from afar.

13:28.840 --> 13:31.030
They wouldn't let you leave empty-handed.

13:31.030 --> 13:32.090
The travel expenses
for the imperial examination

13:32.090 --> 13:33.390
are not that important.

13:33.390 --> 13:34.080
I suppose they're not

13:34.080 --> 13:35.540
worthy of your attention.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.870
But a letter of recommendation
from Old Madam Rong

13:37.870 --> 13:40.470
is worth more than ten years
of your hard study.

13:42.150 --> 13:43.280
I was shortsighted.

13:44.150 --> 13:46.080
No harm in staying for the wedding.

13:47.390 --> 13:48.320
Mr. Lu,

13:49.000 --> 13:50.840
no wonder Lady Shanbao
thinks so highly of you.

13:50.840 --> 13:54.080
Your thoughts and considerations are
truly beyond the ken of ordinary people.

13:54.080 --> 13:56.030
I'll speak plainly
even though we're not close.

13:56.030 --> 13:58.090
What I admire most is your composure.

13:58.240 --> 13:59.600
Even if the sky were falling,

13:59.600 --> 14:01.130
you wouldn't bat an eyelid.

14:02.510 --> 14:04.970
You flatter me.
I don't deserve such praise.

14:05.480 --> 14:08.240
I'm going to find Shanbao
and demand an explanation!

14:08.240 --> 14:08.840
Mr. Wen!

14:16.130 --> 14:21.060
♪ Who tears a strand
of light from the dark night? ♪

14:22.920 --> 14:27.920
♪ It jolts my already silent heart
awake ♪

14:29.650 --> 14:34.420
♪ The moon hangs bright,
as breezes dance among stars ♪

14:35.040 --> 14:40.870
♪ Hear the sighs
for the beauty's fleeting years ♪

14:41.730 --> 14:47.770
♪ Lost in the mortal world,
it fades into twilight ♪

14:48.300 --> 14:54.330
♪ Grass sprouts, orioles sing,
longevity slips away ♪

14:55.010 --> 15:00.930
♪ Love comes in scattered pairs,
yet thoughts linger on ♪

15:00.950 --> 15:07.420
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

15:07.850 --> 15:11.200
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

15:11.240 --> 15:14.410
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

15:14.700 --> 15:16.950
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

15:16.990 --> 15:21.060
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

15:21.240 --> 15:24.810
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

15:21.640 --> 15:22.440
Young Master.

15:24.080 --> 15:24.550
This...

15:24.830 --> 15:27.850
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

15:25.510 --> 15:27.510
The servants are too slack and lazy.

15:27.920 --> 15:34.190
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

15:28.790 --> 15:30.590
The teapot is completely empty.

15:32.480 --> 15:34.740
I'll fetch another pot of tea right away.

15:41.600 --> 15:42.480
Rong Shanbao.

15:44.660 --> 15:48.020
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

15:45.080 --> 15:47.480
It was you
who personally promised me this.

15:48.040 --> 15:51.270
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

15:50.390 --> 15:51.480
Since you've promised me,

15:51.290 --> 15:57.340
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

15:54.810 --> 15:57.270
I will never allow you
to go back on your word.

15:58.040 --> 16:06.980
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

16:08.670 --> 16:10.270
-Lady Yunwan.
-Lady Yunwan.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.270
Lady Yunwan,

16:11.550 --> 16:12.680
where are you going?

16:13.080 --> 16:15.010
Lady Yunwan, it's dangerous here!

16:16.440 --> 16:17.170
Lady Yunwan.

16:17.270 --> 16:18.480
-Lady Yunwan.
-No!

16:18.840 --> 16:20.100
I only want Mrs. Liang!

16:20.440 --> 16:21.200
Lady Yunwan,

16:21.280 --> 16:23.000
you haven't eaten anything all day.

16:23.000 --> 16:23.870
This is your favorite

16:23.870 --> 16:24.670
steamed egg custard.

16:24.670 --> 16:26.030
Try a little bit, okay?

16:26.360 --> 16:27.360
Just a little bit.

16:27.470 --> 16:28.110
Come on.

16:30.240 --> 16:31.870
No! I don't want her!

16:31.870 --> 16:33.130
I only want Mrs. Liang!

16:33.130 --> 16:34.670
Go get Mrs. Liang now!

16:34.670 --> 16:36.510
I don't want her! I don't want her!

16:36.510 --> 16:37.960
All right. Calm down.

16:57.960 --> 16:59.360
When did Yunwan

17:00.630 --> 17:02.110
get a new nanny?

17:03.940 --> 17:04.940
Lady Yunyin,

17:05.319 --> 17:06.440
Mrs. Liang,
who used to take care of Lady Yunwan,

17:06.440 --> 17:08.030
was suddenly hit
by fits of chills and fever,

17:08.030 --> 17:09.200
with nonstop diarrhea.

17:09.200 --> 17:11.030
The physician suspected she had malaria.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.720
Lady Shanbao, fearing the illness
would spread to others,

17:12.720 --> 17:14.240
had Mrs. Liang moved out overnight.

17:14.240 --> 17:15.069
Lady Yunwan

17:15.400 --> 17:16.440
will also be moved

17:16.440 --> 17:17.589
to Hualin Courtyard this afternoon.

17:17.589 --> 17:18.589
A lunatic!

17:23.109 --> 17:23.839
Lady Yunwan!

17:24.359 --> 17:26.069
Hurry and take Lady Yunwan back!

17:26.069 --> 17:26.510
Go now!

17:27.160 --> 17:28.420
Let's go, Lady Yunwan.

17:44.430 --> 17:46.080
Why are you staring at me like that?

17:46.080 --> 17:47.480
Which word I said at the ceremony

17:47.480 --> 17:48.080
was false?

17:48.590 --> 17:50.190
I didn't falsely accuse you.

17:50.550 --> 17:52.790
I just exposed your tricks
in front of everyone.

17:52.790 --> 17:53.750
The Tea Bone?

17:54.500 --> 17:55.920
You can fool everyone else,

17:55.920 --> 17:57.320
but you can never fool me!

17:57.790 --> 17:59.520
Is this all you have to say to me?

18:01.310 --> 18:02.340
Over all these years,

18:02.340 --> 18:04.000
you've made so many mistakes.

18:04.240 --> 18:06.170
I've forgiven you again and again,

18:06.360 --> 18:07.880
only because Mother, on her deathbed,

18:07.880 --> 18:09.270
endured all the pain

18:09.920 --> 18:10.790
to put your hand

18:10.790 --> 18:11.880
in mine

18:12.750 --> 18:14.200
and only closed her eyes

18:14.550 --> 18:15.610
when she saw me nod.

18:16.340 --> 18:17.310
But this time,

18:18.190 --> 18:19.850
for your own selfish desires,

18:19.880 --> 18:21.440
you've ruined our reputation

18:21.440 --> 18:23.310
and exposed Wanwan to vicious gossip.

18:23.310 --> 18:25.920
It's my fault for having been too lenient
with you.

18:25.920 --> 18:26.790
From today on,

18:28.190 --> 18:30.190
you are forbidden to go near Wanwan.

18:30.690 --> 18:32.200
If you dare to stir up any more trouble,

18:32.200 --> 18:34.200
you'll end up like Rong Shanchang.

18:35.130 --> 18:36.930
I could turn him into an outcast.

18:37.660 --> 18:39.910
I can also expel you from the Rong family.

18:39.910 --> 18:40.350
You!

18:42.400 --> 18:44.590
You compare me to that good-for-nothing

18:44.590 --> 18:46.400
and want to cast me out
of the Rong family.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.640
Who do you think you are?

18:47.640 --> 18:49.240
Grandmother is still alive!

18:51.540 --> 18:52.830
I dare you to try.

18:58.570 --> 19:00.100
Shanbao! Shanbao!

19:00.680 --> 19:02.600
Lady Shanbao, Mr. Wen is...

19:04.690 --> 19:05.380
Shanbao,

19:05.960 --> 19:08.090
I have something important to ask you.

19:08.860 --> 19:09.860
What a sick joke!

19:10.330 --> 19:12.330
I don't want to be your sister at all!

19:12.510 --> 19:13.640
If I had had a choice,

19:14.110 --> 19:15.640
I'd have chosen to be born
into the Second Branch

19:15.640 --> 19:17.420
and have Yunxi as my real sister.

19:17.420 --> 19:19.620
She would have been far better than you!

19:28.580 --> 19:30.920
She's been influenced by her stepmother's
instigation since childhood,

19:30.920 --> 19:32.380
despising Wanwan deeply.

19:32.550 --> 19:34.350
Coaxed and deceived
by Yunxi and the others,

19:34.350 --> 19:35.780
she has grown attached to them

19:35.780 --> 19:37.480
and treated you as her enemy instead.

19:37.480 --> 19:39.070
She's the most foolish one
in the Rong Mansion.

19:39.070 --> 19:40.330
Don't take it to heart.

19:42.940 --> 19:44.400
I don't blame anyone else.

19:45.220 --> 19:47.880
It's the fault
of her own foolish stubbornness.

19:49.160 --> 19:51.090
Why are you in such a hurry to see me?

19:51.790 --> 19:55.050
Today at the ceremony,
when you chose your future husband,

19:55.240 --> 19:56.110
why did you...

19:56.340 --> 19:57.140
-Why?
-Wen!

19:57.790 --> 19:59.200
On your first day here,

20:00.000 --> 20:01.730
I made everything clear to you.

20:02.310 --> 20:04.040
You're gentle and indecisive,

20:04.350 --> 20:06.160
not cut out to be my future husband.

20:06.160 --> 20:08.310
It would be wiser
to seek your match elsewhere.

20:08.310 --> 20:09.070
My marriage

20:09.750 --> 20:11.080
is none of your concern.

20:11.310 --> 20:12.510
Manzhu, show him out.

20:12.830 --> 20:14.160
Anyone else would have been acceptable.

20:14.160 --> 20:15.000
Anyone else in Xinfang Pavilion

20:15.000 --> 20:16.330
would have been better.

20:16.400 --> 20:17.030
Why did you

20:17.030 --> 20:18.160
have to choose Yang?

20:18.310 --> 20:19.910
He is vile and unscrupulous.

20:20.110 --> 20:20.790
In the martial arts arena,

20:20.790 --> 20:23.050
he tried to destroy others at every turn.

20:23.070 --> 20:24.870
You saw it all with your own eyes.

20:25.680 --> 20:27.280
Why did you still choose him?

20:29.270 --> 20:31.720
No. Something's not right.

20:32.190 --> 20:34.050
You must have some hidden reason.

20:34.070 --> 20:35.790
If you tell me everything honestly,

20:35.790 --> 20:38.110
perhaps I can help solve your problem.

20:42.370 --> 20:43.830
If you don't tell me the truth,

20:43.830 --> 20:44.890
I won't leave here!

20:55.070 --> 20:57.030
When I set my mind against something,

20:57.030 --> 20:59.490
no one in this world
could ever talk me round.

20:59.640 --> 21:01.300
I chose Yang Dingchen myself.

21:01.790 --> 21:03.590
I can bear all the consequences.

21:06.070 --> 21:08.030
Fine. If you don't leave,

21:08.880 --> 21:09.880
then I'll leave.

21:11.270 --> 21:11.880
Shanbao!

21:12.180 --> 21:13.450
Mr. Wen! Mr. Wen!

21:13.480 --> 21:13.980
Bao.

21:14.000 --> 21:15.600
You know Lady Shanbao's temper.

21:15.600 --> 21:17.000
Don't make things worse.

21:21.310 --> 21:22.070
Why?

21:22.920 --> 21:24.440
Why did you choose him?

21:40.140 --> 21:41.340
Lady Rong Shanbao.

21:42.310 --> 21:44.110
Don't make the wrong choice.

21:51.160 --> 21:51.960
Lady Shanbao.

22:17.140 --> 22:17.620
Come on.

22:18.050 --> 22:20.050
Plant this row of flowers over there.

22:20.050 --> 22:21.510
This row, plant it over there.

22:21.510 --> 22:22.110
All right.

22:34.830 --> 22:35.740
Plant a few more.

22:35.740 --> 22:36.460
No problem.

22:36.550 --> 22:38.380
Jun Dai, get a few more hands over here.

22:38.380 --> 22:38.860
Okay.

22:40.000 --> 22:41.930
Move all those flowers over there.

22:52.580 --> 22:53.380
Lady Shanbao.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.550
What are you all up to?

22:59.310 --> 23:00.680
I saw this place was littered
with dead branches

23:00.680 --> 23:01.750
and overgrown with weeds,

23:01.750 --> 23:03.030
so I brought some people
to weed the garden.

23:03.030 --> 23:04.030
You know nothing!

23:04.160 --> 23:05.030
Lady Shanbao deliberately

23:05.030 --> 23:06.310
had us leave it untouched

23:06.310 --> 23:07.510
so that it would grow naturally

23:07.510 --> 23:09.240
and become authentic wild tea.

23:13.830 --> 23:15.290
Sorry that I overstepped.

23:16.070 --> 23:17.930
Please forgive me, Lady Shanbao.

23:31.000 --> 23:33.130
What made you think of planting these?

23:33.710 --> 23:35.510
Don't stop. Continue planting.

23:37.000 --> 23:38.720
The other day I went to the tea plantation
on the mountain.

23:38.720 --> 23:40.050
I happened
to hear the old tea master mention

23:40.050 --> 23:40.790
that you once

23:40.790 --> 23:41.790
set a strict rule.

23:42.880 --> 23:45.920
Before processing tea, one must bathe
and change into clean clothes.

23:45.920 --> 23:47.590
They must also
wash their hands thoroughly 3 times

23:47.590 --> 23:49.380
before entering the tea plantation.

23:49.380 --> 23:50.550
This is to prevent any body odor

23:50.550 --> 23:52.400
from mingling with the tea's fragrance.

23:52.400 --> 23:54.640
Tea bushes are planted
all over the Rong family courtyard.

23:54.640 --> 23:55.480
But only here

23:55.750 --> 23:57.080
stands a magnolia tree.

23:57.530 --> 23:58.920
There are pines to the east

23:58.920 --> 24:00.750
and sweet osmanthus trees to the west.

24:00.750 --> 24:03.270
I suppose that since you know
how to ward off unwanted smells,

24:03.270 --> 24:06.470
you must be even better
at incorporating desirable ones.

24:27.250 --> 24:32.080
♪ The moonlight chases its way
up to the mountain peak ♪

24:32.270 --> 24:34.300
People come and go
in this garden every day,

24:34.300 --> 24:39.800
♪ I lift my head and see the faint trace
of spring snow on your brow ♪

24:35.640 --> 24:38.100
but you're the first
who has ever noticed it.

24:41.660 --> 24:47.060
♪ Years of being buried
in paperwork and official business ♪

24:42.240 --> 24:44.440
The tea leaves imbued with the essences

24:44.680 --> 24:46.480
of magnolia, pine and osmanthus

24:46.830 --> 24:48.030
reflect your wisdom,

24:48.880 --> 24:50.000
which is beyond the grasp
of average people.

24:49.440 --> 24:54.810
♪ Who makes the kite snap its string? ♪

24:51.270 --> 24:52.880
I see tall trees above,

24:53.960 --> 24:55.620
with tea bushes in the middle.

24:55.740 --> 24:56.500
If we plant

24:56.520 --> 25:01.970
♪ Fate must intend for us
to be bound together ♪

24:57.000 --> 24:59.660
some chrysanthemums
and orchids on the ground,

25:01.680 --> 25:03.480
it will enhance the tea's fragrance

25:03.480 --> 25:04.590
and also prevent weeds from growing.

25:03.550 --> 25:09.150
♪ That's why so many challenges are set ♪

25:10.780 --> 25:16.020
♪ I can never get enough of looking ♪

25:17.060 --> 25:23.300
♪ At this charming
and enchanting smiling face ♪

25:24.430 --> 25:25.390
Don't you have anything to ask me?

25:24.520 --> 25:31.190
♪ I cross mountains and rivers
to rush to your presence ♪

25:31.680 --> 25:37.980
♪ We face each other, tears
streaming down, yet unable to speak ♪

25:38.930 --> 25:45.080
♪ Afraid that the dream is just a sham,
frightening away the pair of swallows ♪

25:46.020 --> 25:53.050
♪ Can we, in this lifetime,
share the moon's beauty from afar? ♪

25:51.770 --> 25:53.510
Lady Shanbao, whatever you want to do,

25:53.510 --> 26:00.580
♪ The myriad stars in the sky
can't fully convey our endless affection ♪

25:53.880 --> 25:55.540
there is surely a good reason.

25:57.030 --> 25:58.960
Anything that troubles you so much

25:59.350 --> 26:00.730
must be no trivial challenge.

26:00.730 --> 26:08.090
♪ The wind wafts
in countless thoughts of longing ♪

26:02.000 --> 26:03.530
There's no need for me to pry

26:03.750 --> 26:05.010
and become a nuisance.

26:08.120 --> 26:14.450
♪ Love exists among mountains and rivers.
Who says it couldn't be fully achieved? ♪

26:15.330 --> 26:21.950
♪ Every single day with you
feels like our very first encounter ♪

26:18.970 --> 26:19.620
However,

26:20.490 --> 26:21.770
when you need help,

26:22.880 --> 26:24.480
don't hesitate to call on me.

26:36.380 --> 26:37.110
Done.

26:41.510 --> 26:42.240
Follow me.

27:11.010 --> 27:13.380
Mr. Yang, what is the meaning of this?

27:13.790 --> 27:15.000
I know the Rong family

27:15.000 --> 27:16.020
handles marriages differently,

27:16.020 --> 27:17.010
skipping all those

27:17.010 --> 27:18.610
lengthy betrothal formalities.

27:18.610 --> 27:20.540
Yet a marriage joins two families.

27:20.630 --> 27:22.360
It must not be treated lightly.

27:22.670 --> 27:25.800
I have brought some small gifts
as a token of my sincerity.

27:25.800 --> 27:27.350
Go inside and announce my arrival.

27:27.350 --> 27:28.350
Just tell them...

27:30.760 --> 27:31.960
Just go and do as I say.

27:33.880 --> 27:35.940
The wedding date has not yet been set.

27:37.320 --> 27:38.180
My young master

27:38.310 --> 27:38.960
has specifically come today

27:38.960 --> 27:40.760
to seek Lady Shanbao's opinion.

27:40.880 --> 27:42.350
Mr. Yang, you've come
at an inopportune time.

27:42.350 --> 27:43.070
Lady Shanbao has just

27:43.070 --> 27:44.070
left the mansion.

27:45.420 --> 27:46.860
Who did she go out with?

27:47.870 --> 27:50.270
I suspect she's deliberately avoiding me.

27:51.190 --> 27:52.750
Then I'll go inside and wait.

27:52.750 --> 27:53.260
Let's go inside.

27:53.260 --> 27:53.880
Mr. Yang.

27:55.050 --> 27:55.660
Mr. Yang.

27:55.680 --> 27:57.210
I am Lady Shanbao's fiancé!

27:57.600 --> 27:59.130
Who dares to stand in my way?

27:59.750 --> 28:00.550
Well, well!

28:00.920 --> 28:04.010
After all that picking and choosing,
she got herself a hothead.

28:04.010 --> 28:05.820
This is going to be fun.

28:07.270 --> 28:08.070
Lady Shanbao,

28:08.310 --> 28:09.160
the low-yield plantation

28:09.160 --> 28:09.960
is just ahead.

28:10.360 --> 28:11.460
Among this year's
first spring tea harvest,

28:11.460 --> 28:13.030
its tea is of the poorest quality.

28:13.030 --> 28:14.350
I had my men follow the usual practice

28:14.350 --> 28:15.680
of applying more fertilizer
and doing pest control,

28:15.680 --> 28:16.810
but nothing worked.

28:17.160 --> 28:18.180
Lady Shanbao, today you're here

28:18.180 --> 28:19.910
to treat the ailing tea plants?

28:20.480 --> 28:21.350
This was the first tea plantation

28:21.350 --> 28:22.680
I took over when I was 13.

28:23.020 --> 28:24.950
Come with me. I'll show you around.

28:47.790 --> 28:48.590
Lady Shanbao.

28:49.200 --> 28:50.070
Old Madam Rong heard

28:50.070 --> 28:51.550
about the poor harvest
in the old tea plantations

28:51.550 --> 28:52.350
this year.

28:52.640 --> 28:54.900
She specifically invited Mr. Yan to come

28:55.440 --> 28:57.480
to help you take a look.

29:04.920 --> 29:06.380
Old Madam Rong was joking.

29:06.780 --> 29:08.480
Lady Shanbao, your expertise in tea

29:08.480 --> 29:09.690
is well known to everyone.

29:09.690 --> 29:11.200
I wouldn't dare to show off
in front of an expert

29:11.200 --> 29:12.600
and make a fool of myself.

29:12.790 --> 29:14.680
I am merely here to observe and learn.

29:14.680 --> 29:16.310
Mr. Yan, you arrived here early.

29:16.310 --> 29:17.440
What have you found?

29:17.620 --> 29:19.280
I've just taken a look around.

29:19.440 --> 29:21.110
And I have a couple of thoughts.

29:21.110 --> 29:22.840
The tea plants here are too old,

29:23.270 --> 29:24.680
and their buds are poorly developed.

29:24.680 --> 29:25.480
Lady Shanbao,

29:25.510 --> 29:27.350
we have tended to this place
with great care.

29:27.350 --> 29:28.550
We've also transplanted
many new tea plants

29:28.550 --> 29:29.640
to replace the dead ones.

29:29.640 --> 29:30.440
But for some reason,

29:30.440 --> 29:31.920
they just won't grow properly.

29:31.920 --> 29:34.070
It's simply because years of rain erosion

29:34.070 --> 29:35.590
have depleted the soil's fertility.

29:35.590 --> 29:37.720
That's why the old tea plants
are withering and dying,

29:37.720 --> 29:40.180
and the new ones
are prematurely declining.

29:42.200 --> 29:43.130
Look at this one.

29:46.960 --> 29:48.290
The branches are ashen,

29:48.830 --> 29:50.360
covered in overgrown moss.

29:50.960 --> 29:52.760
How could it possibly flourish?

29:53.480 --> 29:55.410
And this one is in even worse shape.

29:56.110 --> 29:58.310
The roots are exposed above the ground.

29:58.400 --> 30:00.640
No matter how much fertilizer you apply,

30:00.640 --> 30:03.040
it's just not enough
to make up for the loss.

30:03.340 --> 30:04.880
A sick tea plant is like a sick person.

30:04.880 --> 30:06.720
Each requires its own prescription.

30:06.720 --> 30:08.110
No matter how dedicated
the tea workers are,

30:08.110 --> 30:09.910
they don't have such expertise.

30:09.940 --> 30:11.600
There's no need to blame them.

30:12.620 --> 30:14.080
That makes perfect sense.

30:14.360 --> 30:16.350
I originally intended to have stone ridges

30:16.350 --> 30:18.030
built along the mountain slopes,

30:18.030 --> 30:19.690
with some sandy soil added in.

30:20.400 --> 30:22.590
But there's too much work
in the tea plantations now.

30:22.590 --> 30:24.000
We simply can't spare the manpower.

30:24.000 --> 30:25.720
No need to go through all that trouble.

30:25.720 --> 30:28.050
Why not just use local materials instead?

30:28.920 --> 30:31.030
In the past, I often saw the masters
on the mountain

30:31.030 --> 30:33.240
make use of cut grass
and fallen branches.

30:33.240 --> 30:34.840
Why don't we give it a try too?

30:35.720 --> 30:36.270
I believe

30:36.590 --> 30:38.350
the tea plants in this plantation

30:38.350 --> 30:39.480
will grow well soon.

30:40.830 --> 30:42.830
As the old saying goes,

30:42.830 --> 30:44.640
birds of a feather flock together.

30:44.640 --> 30:47.240
A person's virtue lies
in knowing their place.

30:47.510 --> 30:48.960
Pigs will never fly.

30:49.590 --> 30:50.640
They may inflate themselves

30:50.640 --> 30:51.840
with all their might,

30:52.310 --> 30:54.170
but the sky won't come any closer.

30:55.880 --> 30:57.280
So I'd advise some people

30:58.200 --> 31:00.310
to stop overestimating
their own abilities.

31:00.310 --> 31:02.470
You seem quite
aware of your limited abilities.

31:02.470 --> 31:02.950
You!

31:02.970 --> 31:03.770
Lady Shanbao.

31:03.990 --> 31:04.430
I...

31:05.960 --> 31:06.760
Lady Shanbao.

31:08.070 --> 31:08.900
On our way up the mountain,

31:08.900 --> 31:09.980
Yi was worrying

31:10.420 --> 31:11.270
that today we wouldn't make it

31:11.270 --> 31:12.640
to the new plantation on the back hill.

31:12.640 --> 31:14.160
Fortunately, with Mr. Yan in charge here,

31:14.160 --> 31:15.400
we're free to go now.

31:17.750 --> 31:18.680
You have a point.

31:19.590 --> 31:20.200
Yi.

31:20.830 --> 31:22.630
Grandmother has invited Mr. Yan
to offer guidance.

31:22.630 --> 31:24.240
No matter how tricky
your tea problems are,

31:24.240 --> 31:25.170
with him around,

31:25.270 --> 31:27.180
they'll all be sorted out smoothly.

31:27.180 --> 31:27.860
Mr. Yan.

31:28.480 --> 31:30.150
During the reclamation
of the back hill wilderness,

31:30.150 --> 31:31.550
we ran into some problems.

31:31.550 --> 31:33.000
I have to go there myself.

31:33.480 --> 31:35.210
I'm leaving this in your hands.

31:35.640 --> 31:36.500
Steward Cheng.

31:36.830 --> 31:37.630
Lady Shanbao.

31:37.920 --> 31:38.720
You stay here.

31:39.630 --> 31:41.290
Just follow Mr. Yan's orders.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.640
Don't act on your own.

31:46.110 --> 31:46.910
Lady Shanbao.

31:47.310 --> 31:48.680
The path to the back hill is rather rough.

31:48.680 --> 31:49.920
Why not let Yi stay here?

31:49.920 --> 31:51.070
I'll accompany you instead.

31:51.070 --> 31:52.440
That won't be necessary.

31:52.440 --> 31:53.880
Yi, lead the way.

31:54.480 --> 31:54.880
Yes.

32:05.340 --> 32:06.440
Sorry to leave you with this, Mr. Yan.

32:06.440 --> 32:07.700
I'll take my leave now.

32:14.230 --> 32:16.440
Young Master,
you came here for Lady Shanbao,

32:16.440 --> 32:18.370
but Lu Fusheng ruined everything.

32:18.440 --> 32:19.380
Is he a tea expert?

32:19.380 --> 32:20.350
Or is he a tea physician?

32:20.350 --> 32:22.110
Why on earth does he need to tag along?

32:22.110 --> 32:22.680
Shixin,

32:23.920 --> 32:25.250
don't speak out of turn.

32:27.110 --> 32:27.970
Steward Cheng.

32:29.680 --> 32:30.750
Just now I noticed Lady Shanbao

32:30.750 --> 32:31.880
looked quite tired.

32:31.880 --> 32:33.830
She must have been jostled by the journey

32:33.830 --> 32:35.160
in that light carriage.

32:35.560 --> 32:37.960
My carriage is rather spacious
and comfortable.

32:37.960 --> 32:39.920
Please have someone inform Lady Shanbao

32:39.920 --> 32:42.180
that she can use mine for the return trip.

32:42.350 --> 32:45.150
I'll be waiting
at the foot of the mountain at 3 p.m.

32:45.790 --> 32:46.350
Yes.

32:52.720 --> 32:53.520
Lady Shanbao,

32:53.540 --> 32:55.310
it's not that they are unwilling
to work hard.

32:55.310 --> 32:56.740
With the spring harvest in full swing,

32:56.740 --> 32:57.720
we can't spare many hands

32:57.720 --> 32:58.510
right now.

33:05.830 --> 33:07.200
Fertilizing is the top priority.

33:07.200 --> 33:08.880
Get them to do shallow ploughing first.

33:08.880 --> 33:10.810
Then hurry up and dig trenches
to apply fertilizer.

33:10.810 --> 33:12.240
We need
to build up the soil's fertility first.

33:12.240 --> 33:13.830
We can do the deeper ploughing next month
when things ease up.

33:13.830 --> 33:14.620
Don't worry, Lady Shanbao.

33:14.620 --> 33:16.020
I understand all of this.

33:28.890 --> 33:29.590
Be careful!

33:29.640 --> 33:31.100
Is Lady Shanbao all right?

33:35.720 --> 33:37.310
Thank goodness no one was hurt.

33:37.310 --> 33:38.840
Are you okay, Lady Shanbao?

33:39.230 --> 33:40.030
Lady Shanbao.

33:40.920 --> 33:42.720
Lady Shanbao, are you all right?

33:43.400 --> 33:44.310
Watch where you're going!

33:44.310 --> 33:45.420
Are those eyes just for decoration?

33:45.420 --> 33:46.630
Why not just gouge them out
and add them to the compost?

33:46.630 --> 33:47.540
Yi, I'm sorry.

33:47.880 --> 33:49.070
Please don't be angry, Lady Shanbao.

33:49.070 --> 33:50.480
I must have been out of my mind.

33:50.480 --> 33:51.000
So...

33:51.550 --> 33:53.640
Alright, you've worked all day

33:53.720 --> 33:54.720
and must be tired.

33:54.920 --> 33:57.000
I've asked Manzhu
to prepare some herbal tea and pastries.

33:57.000 --> 33:58.330
Take a break, everyone.

33:58.510 --> 34:00.590
Thank you, Lady Shanbao.

34:00.790 --> 34:01.650
Get out of here!

34:01.980 --> 34:03.480
You were quick on your feet.

34:03.480 --> 34:04.240
Are you hurt?

34:09.190 --> 34:10.960
Lady Shanbao, it's getting late.

34:10.960 --> 34:13.820
Mr. Yan is still waiting
at the foot of the mountain.

34:14.630 --> 34:15.429
Right, right!

34:15.480 --> 34:16.880
We mustn't keep Mr. Yan
waiting a moment longer.

34:16.880 --> 34:17.480
Let's go.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.590
Did you twist your ankle?

34:24.590 --> 34:26.520
I was fine standing still just now,

34:26.800 --> 34:27.760
but when I moved,

34:30.679 --> 34:32.449
I think... I think it's broken.

34:35.840 --> 34:37.370
Don't worry, Lady Shanbao.

34:37.710 --> 34:38.480
I'm fine.

34:39.070 --> 34:40.000
It won't kill me.

34:41.150 --> 34:42.150
You should go now.

34:53.670 --> 34:54.530
Steward Cheng.

34:55.150 --> 34:57.480
Have you sent someone to ask Lady Shanbao?

34:58.800 --> 35:00.360
Mr. Yan, I wouldn't dare
to keep you waiting in vain.

35:00.360 --> 35:02.030
Lady Shanbao has certainly agreed to come.

35:02.030 --> 35:03.690
She'll probably be here soon.

35:06.670 --> 35:07.630
Mr. Yan!

35:08.630 --> 35:09.550
Mr. Yan!

35:11.190 --> 35:12.070
Mr. Yan!

35:14.920 --> 35:15.630
Mr. Yan,

35:16.110 --> 35:18.150
Lady Shanbao was planning to come down,

35:18.150 --> 35:19.920
but Mr. Lu unfortunately
sprained his ankle,

35:19.920 --> 35:20.720
holding us up.

35:21.070 --> 35:22.880
So she asked you to return first.

35:24.230 --> 35:26.310
Steward Cheng, Lady Shanbao ordered you

35:26.310 --> 35:27.530
to quickly find a sedan chair

35:27.530 --> 35:28.890
to carry Mr. Lu down the mountain

35:28.890 --> 35:29.890
and take him

35:29.910 --> 35:31.000
to Woodcutter Wang for treatment.

35:31.000 --> 35:32.440
His family's secret recipe
for bruises and sprains

35:32.440 --> 35:33.150
is the most effective.

35:33.150 --> 35:34.350
It works like a charm.

35:36.380 --> 35:37.820
Are you deaf? Go now.

35:42.720 --> 35:43.360
Mr. Yan.

35:43.760 --> 35:45.440
Lady Shanbao has asked you
to renturn first.

35:45.440 --> 35:46.900
You'd better head off now.

35:49.230 --> 35:50.690
Did Lady Shanbao get hurt?

35:51.400 --> 35:52.930
Take me to her immediately.

35:53.330 --> 35:53.930
All right.

35:57.830 --> 35:58.630
Let's go back.

36:04.230 --> 36:05.480
Few of those suitors at the Rong Mansion

36:05.480 --> 36:06.630
stand a chance.

36:07.360 --> 36:08.280
But you and Lady Shanbao

36:08.280 --> 36:09.480
just hit it off.

36:09.880 --> 36:10.960
You're a perfect match

36:10.960 --> 36:12.360
with the same interests.

36:12.800 --> 36:13.670
If Lady Shanbao
doesn't marry her soulmate,

36:13.670 --> 36:14.920
then who else could she possibly marry?

36:14.920 --> 36:16.610
But Lu Fusheng
came to mess things up.

36:16.610 --> 36:18.070
He was deliberately causing trouble
just now.

36:18.070 --> 36:18.800
This has happened several times.

36:18.800 --> 36:19.750
And you're still tolerating him?

36:19.750 --> 36:20.310
Shut up.

36:21.760 --> 36:22.760
Since when

36:23.280 --> 36:24.150
did I teach you

36:24.670 --> 36:25.510
to gossip

36:25.510 --> 36:26.400
and backbite?

36:26.920 --> 36:27.760
I was just

36:27.760 --> 36:29.070
standing up for you, Young Master.

36:29.070 --> 36:31.400
He was taking advantage of your kindness.

36:37.190 --> 36:38.120
What's going on?

36:38.360 --> 36:39.070
Young Master,

36:39.070 --> 36:39.960
the wheel got stuck in a pit

36:39.960 --> 36:40.840
and was knocked against a rock,

36:40.840 --> 36:42.550
cracking a seam. We can't pry it out.

36:42.550 --> 36:43.360
It's getting dark soon.

36:43.360 --> 36:44.440
Figure something out!

36:44.440 --> 36:44.880
Yes.

36:50.620 --> 36:51.350
Go.

37:02.780 --> 37:03.650
Push harder.

37:05.940 --> 37:07.490
Is that Mr. Yan over there?

37:12.190 --> 37:13.950
I'm heading back to the mansion too.

37:13.950 --> 37:15.410
If you don't mind, Mr. Yan,

37:15.920 --> 37:17.580
please join me in my carriage.

37:17.710 --> 37:19.430
Thank you for your kind offer, Lady Yunxi.

37:19.430 --> 37:20.620
But men and women

37:20.670 --> 37:22.350
should keep a proper distance.

37:22.350 --> 37:24.670
I have never shared a carriage
with a woman,

37:24.670 --> 37:25.800
just to avoid unnecessary gossip

37:25.800 --> 37:26.530
and trouble.

37:27.350 --> 37:27.960
I have already sent someone

37:27.960 --> 37:29.620
to the village ahead for help.

37:29.800 --> 37:32.200
Please continue your journey, Lady Yunxi.

37:40.070 --> 37:41.190
It's getting dark.

37:41.510 --> 37:43.590
I'm afraid
you'll have a long wait, Mr. Yan.

37:43.590 --> 37:45.030
You might be hungry.

37:45.320 --> 37:47.320
Let my maid offer you some pastries.

37:48.940 --> 37:51.270
You wouldn't refuse even this, would you?

37:51.440 --> 37:53.230
Thank you for your concern, Lady Yunxi.

37:53.230 --> 37:55.230
I've already eaten on the mountain.

37:55.710 --> 37:57.000
Oh my goodness!

37:57.790 --> 38:00.070
Mr. Yan, you guard your reputation
so carefully,

38:00.070 --> 38:01.670
avoiding me like the plague,

38:02.030 --> 38:04.030
as if I were some venomous creature.

38:05.280 --> 38:07.680
I wonder if she appreciates your devotion.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.550
Be careful, Mr. Yan.

38:13.510 --> 38:16.150
It takes two to tango.

38:16.830 --> 38:19.100
Don't let all your efforts end up in vain.

38:21.710 --> 38:22.240
Let's go.

38:24.200 --> 38:25.200
How ungrateful.

38:37.550 --> 38:38.350
Young Master,

38:38.440 --> 38:39.840
Lady Yunxi was only trying to be kind.

38:39.840 --> 38:41.320
Why did you push her away so coldly?

38:41.320 --> 38:42.280
Wouldn't it be better
to ride back with her

38:42.280 --> 38:43.210
in her carriage?

38:43.840 --> 38:44.630
I should've let you

38:44.630 --> 38:46.150
starve to death by the roadside.

38:46.150 --> 38:48.150
It would've been better
than ending up with you annoying me.

38:48.150 --> 38:50.150
Go find someone to help us right now.

38:50.190 --> 38:51.360
You just keep waiting and wishing.

38:51.360 --> 38:52.400
You can wait till the cows come home

38:52.400 --> 38:52.920
and see if Lady Shanbao

38:52.920 --> 38:54.050
spares you a glance.

38:54.320 --> 38:55.780
Fine, fine! I'm going now!

39:25.360 --> 39:26.510
Old Madam Rong has sent Nianqiao

39:26.510 --> 39:27.670
to inquire twice already.

39:27.670 --> 39:28.840
And that Mr. Yang...

39:29.830 --> 39:31.690
He refused to leave Qilan Garden.

39:31.870 --> 39:33.330
The servants were afraid,

39:33.670 --> 39:35.200
not daring to send him away.

39:36.510 --> 39:38.240
Let's go to Chongxi Hall first.

39:50.590 --> 39:51.450
Steward Cheng.

39:52.190 --> 39:52.670
Yes.

39:53.020 --> 39:54.150
You personally send Fusheng

39:54.150 --> 39:55.400
back to Xinfang Pavilion.

39:55.400 --> 39:56.800
And take good care of him.

39:59.390 --> 39:59.870
Yes.

40:11.230 --> 40:13.360
Help Steward Lu out of the sedan chair.

40:14.720 --> 40:15.920
Steward Lu, please.

40:18.740 --> 40:20.650
I am hardly worthy

40:21.070 --> 40:23.070
of such kindness from Lady Shanbao.

40:23.860 --> 40:25.390
Steward Cheng, sorry to trouble you

40:25.390 --> 40:27.050
to take care of me personally.

40:48.800 --> 40:49.430
Thank you.

40:50.480 --> 40:52.660
Yang Dingchen is not someone
to be messed with.

40:52.660 --> 40:54.790
We'll see how long you can keep this up.

40:56.080 --> 40:57.740
With your limited abilities,

40:57.900 --> 40:59.170
all you can do is watch

40:59.270 --> 41:00.400
from the sidelines.

41:00.880 --> 41:02.610
Young Master, watch your step.

41:12.260 --> 41:13.590
Everyone may leave now.

41:14.480 --> 41:15.070
Yes.

41:27.600 --> 41:28.400
Grandmother.

41:31.480 --> 41:33.590
You've agreed
to the Yang family's proposal.

41:33.590 --> 41:35.660
Originally, I didn't want
to go against your wish.

41:35.660 --> 41:36.800
However, the Rong and Yan families

41:36.800 --> 41:38.310
have had a marriage alliance
for generations.

41:38.310 --> 41:40.870
Yan Bailou is of noble character

41:40.900 --> 41:42.300
and exceptional talent.

41:42.370 --> 41:44.290
Giving up such a fine man

41:44.510 --> 41:45.110
is truly like

41:45.110 --> 41:46.770
trading jade for common rock.

41:47.110 --> 41:48.360
If you were a man,

41:48.640 --> 41:50.640
I would arrange for you to have both.

41:51.400 --> 41:52.550
One would be your wife,
and the other your concubine.

41:52.550 --> 41:54.010
That would be convenient.

41:54.190 --> 41:55.550
But you are a woman,

41:56.030 --> 41:57.320
so you must keep your eyes open

41:57.320 --> 41:59.010
and carefully choose the best one.

41:59.010 --> 42:01.000
I've worked hard
to create opportunities for you,

42:01.000 --> 42:02.520
yet you cast him aside.

42:03.660 --> 42:04.950
This is nonsense.

42:07.070 --> 42:08.710
Grandmother, you have such keen insight.

42:08.710 --> 42:10.400
You've always been
a good judge of character.

42:10.400 --> 42:12.190
I could never match you in that regard.

42:12.190 --> 42:13.510
Mr. Yan is truly outstanding

42:13.510 --> 42:14.710
and beyond reproach.

42:14.890 --> 42:17.480
But I publicly accepted
the Yang family's proposal.

42:17.480 --> 42:18.960
It would be truly improper
to go back on my word.

42:18.960 --> 42:19.840
Don't lie to me.

42:21.800 --> 42:23.660
For that useless mother of yours,

42:23.800 --> 42:25.470
you've sacrificed a lot.

42:25.800 --> 42:27.190
But she just closed her eyes

42:27.190 --> 42:28.150
and left the world,

42:28.150 --> 42:29.840
passing her chaos down to you.

42:30.670 --> 42:32.280
How long will you keep

42:32.740 --> 42:34.970
cleaning up the mess she left behind?

42:36.550 --> 42:38.280
A Rong daughter's choice of husband

42:38.280 --> 42:40.010
has always been her own to make.

42:40.230 --> 42:42.690
Grandmother, I beg you
to grant me this wish.

42:49.920 --> 42:51.630
This is indeed the old family

42:51.630 --> 42:52.550
tradition.

42:54.890 --> 42:57.730
But when young people
stray from the right path,

42:58.400 --> 43:00.460
their elders must set them straight!

43:01.710 --> 43:03.890
I am determined to see this match through.

43:03.890 --> 43:05.110
You have several younger sisters

43:05.110 --> 43:06.240
who have come of age.

43:06.880 --> 43:08.850
Surely one
more considerate and filial than you

43:08.850 --> 43:10.710
will cherish my good intentions.

43:11.440 --> 43:12.800
But let me be clear.

43:13.550 --> 43:16.760
Once such a precedent is set,

43:19.000 --> 43:20.860
no one can restrain what follows.

43:22.090 --> 43:24.550
Others will shoulder burdens
meant for you,

43:25.290 --> 43:26.290
and the family

43:27.030 --> 43:30.030
will inevitably be torn apart
by disputes and fights.

43:31.060 --> 43:32.260
When that time comes,

43:34.760 --> 43:36.320
I will no longer be able

43:36.350 --> 43:37.470
to speak up for you.

46:14.300 --> 46:16.400
[Herbal Tea]

46:20.800 --> 46:21.600
Young Master.

46:23.150 --> 46:23.630
This...

46:24.510 --> 46:26.510
The servants are too slack and lazy.

46:27.800 --> 46:29.600
The teapot is completely empty.

46:31.360 --> 46:32.790
I'll fetch another pot of tea right away.

46:31.560 --> 46:33.230
[Lord Lu is in a bad mood.]

46:33.260 --> 46:35.900
[How about a cup of herbal tea
to calm down?]

46:36.040 --> 46:36.880
When it comes to herbal tea,

46:36.880 --> 46:38.240
it's certainly no stranger to most people.

46:38.240 --> 46:40.070
Especially in today's
Guangdong and Guangxi,

46:40.070 --> 46:41.440
herbal tea is the top-selling

46:41.440 --> 46:42.630
summer drink.

46:43.550 --> 46:44.760
The origin of herbal tea

46:44.760 --> 46:45.840
is closely related
to traditional Chinese medicine

46:45.840 --> 46:48.040
and the region's humid and hot climate.

46:48.080 --> 46:49.710
Since ancient times, the Lingnan region
has been rife with miasma.

46:49.710 --> 46:50.670
Intense humidity and heat interact,

46:50.670 --> 46:51.980
easily inducing internal heat.

46:51.980 --> 46:52.930
The ancient locals

46:52.930 --> 46:54.360
decocted medicinal herbs into drinks,

46:54.360 --> 46:55.590
which are used to clear heat,
detoxify

46:55.590 --> 46:57.690
and balance one's body constitution.

46:57.690 --> 46:59.390
The herbal tea culture embodies the wisdom

46:59.390 --> 47:00.790
of preventive medicine in TCM,

47:00.790 --> 47:02.430
emphasizing natural regulation.

47:02.430 --> 47:03.980
Recipes often combine
dozens of medicinal herbs

47:03.980 --> 47:05.630
such as honeysuckle and selfheal spike.

47:05.630 --> 47:06.790
It not only relieves summer heat
and dispels dampness,

47:06.790 --> 47:08.270
but also has been deeply integrated
into the daily life of the local people.

47:08.270 --> 47:09.270
In 2006,

47:09.360 --> 47:10.590
the art of making herbal tea

47:10.590 --> 47:12.110
was listed as a national
intangible cultural heritage,

47:12.110 --> 47:12.480
becoming

47:12.480 --> 47:14.430
a symbol of Chinese wellness culture.

47:14.430 --> 47:14.910
Today,

47:14.960 --> 47:15.880
herbal tea has become

47:15.880 --> 47:17.280
a carrier of nostalgia
for overseas Chinese.

47:17.280 --> 47:18.510
In the modern context,

47:18.510 --> 47:19.190
new variants

47:19.190 --> 47:21.330
such as sugar-free and fruit-flavored
versions have also emerged.

47:21.330 --> 47:23.150
Yet its core essence remains deeply rooted

47:23.150 --> 47:25.190
in the traditional wisdom
of harmony between humans and nature,

47:25.190 --> 47:26.550
becoming a lifestyle

47:26.550 --> 47:27.710
that has persisted for millennia.
